    """
    This test verifies that when execute_async is called with async_execution=True,
    the ContextVar state set on the calling thread is preserved inside the worker thread.

    On the buggy codebase, the ContextVar will be reset to default (None) inside the thread,
    causing the test to fail. After the fix, the ContextVar value is preserved and test passes.
